  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Recycling Fish</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COPESCARTE will convert a donated space into a tannery and office and will refine the skills of its member-craftswomen who use fish skin to make leather and leather articles. The improved plant and products should result in better sales, benefiting the 21 workers as well as their nearly 300 family members and, eventually, the 30 new members expected to join the cooperative. (BR-856)</narrative>
  </description>
